<title>AUSTRIA: Saudi oil minister arrives for OPEC without a word.</title>
<headline>Saudi oil minister arrives for OPEC without a word.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabian oil minister Ali bin Ibrahim al-Nuaimi arrived here on Tuesday for Wednesday's OPEC meeting but declined to make any comment to waiting reporters.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
